WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
video file & English subtitles: Safex

00:00:11.245 --> 00:00:13.713
Dr. Leonard learned

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:18.150
that Candy moved out of the dormitory
and lived with Mr. Albert.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:22.283
He wanted Candy to move back,
or she had to quit her job right away.

00:00:22.483 --> 00:00:25.288
She had to choose.

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:35.057
Far from reach but near at hand

00:01:00.494 --> 00:01:02.421
I'm back, Mr. Albert!

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:10.170
Candy, welcome back.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.305
Why are you wearing the apron?

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:14.999
- How does it look?
- Very pretty.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:19.473
Try my cooking today.

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:21.548
I can't do it.

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:26.142
Mr. Albert finally got happier,
I can't leave him like this.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:30.356
Candy, what did Dr. Leonard see you for?

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:31.858
You saw that?

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:33.516
Seems like
you were being blamed for something.

00:01:35.795 --> 00:01:37.595
He was just nagging.

00:01:37.795 --> 00:01:39.391
It smells good!

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:56.714
It feels good!

00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:01.788
Don't wake Candy up, wait...

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:07.793
It looks so familiar...

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:13.128
I have seen it before.

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:26.344
When was that?

00:02:29.516 --> 00:02:31.279
I can't remember!

00:02:35.288 --> 00:02:38.480
Mr. Albert wants to regain his memory.

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:41.023
I should stay with him.

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:44.451
Good morning, Candy!

00:02:44.651 --> 00:02:50.033
Good morning! I overslept.
I got to go to the hospital soon!

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:59.809
Candy, aren't you
on the night shift today?

00:03:03.149 --> 00:03:04.549
You can sleep late.

00:03:04.785 --> 00:03:07.513
Today something important
is happening at the hospital.

00:03:15.895 --> 00:03:19.023
For Mr. Albert's sake,
I can't quit the job at the hospital.

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:21.290
I am going to beg Dr. Leonard.

00:03:26.005 --> 00:03:27.739
Got to go now!

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:44.013
Did Mr. Albert
figured out that I was fired?

00:03:51.497 --> 00:03:53.899
I don't want to repeat what I say.

00:03:54.099 --> 00:03:57.403
As soon as Mr. Albert regains his memory,
I'll move back to the dormitory.

00:03:57.603 --> 00:03:58.771
So...

00:03:58.971 --> 00:04:00.600
Look at this.

00:04:02.542 --> 00:04:03.702
What is it?

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:09.581
A previous army nurse
like Franny, Catherine.

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:12.218
Catherine?

00:04:12.418 --> 00:04:14.612
She sleeps in a tent every day.

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:16.389
- Dr. Leonard...
- Candice!

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:23.190
All my nurses
must be as good as Catherine.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:27.131
Don't come to work anymore.

00:04:39.012 --> 00:04:42.709
What I did might be wrong,

00:04:43.853 --> 00:04:46.950
but I can't quit my job
as a nurse easily.

00:04:52.258 --> 00:04:53.987
A cleaning lady?

00:04:55.128 --> 00:04:56.390
Ok!

00:05:12.678 --> 00:05:13.913
Who...

00:05:14.113 --> 00:05:16.140
I am new today.

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:22.617
Candice!

00:05:24.223 --> 00:05:26.953
I already fired you.

00:05:27.293 --> 00:05:29.661
I know, but I'm not a nurse now.

00:05:29.861 --> 00:05:31.630
I am the new cleaning lady.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:34.455
A cleaning lady?

00:05:34.767 --> 00:05:36.652
Let me clean the desk for you.

00:05:36.852 --> 00:05:38.736
Don't try to buy me!

00:05:43.442 --> 00:05:45.808
Cleaning is my job.

00:05:46.145 --> 00:05:48.636
Who hired you?

00:05:49.415 --> 00:05:51.576
The administrator.

00:05:56.422 --> 00:05:58.356
Senior Nurse,
call the administrator here.

00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:03.353
Dr. Leonard, we just got informed
that Catherine...

00:06:04.964 --> 00:06:06.298
Catherine?

00:06:06.498 --> 00:06:08.923
She was killed in Italy.

00:06:09.435 --> 00:06:10.827
She died?

00:06:13.472 --> 00:06:17.636
Liar! I just received her letter
this morning.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.947
Catherine died...

00:06:34.359 --> 00:06:36.725
I just received her letter...

00:06:36.928 --> 00:06:40.125
- She was not even 20...
- It's true.

00:06:43.702 --> 00:06:45.682
Candy, your uniform...

00:06:45.882 --> 00:06:49.034
I was fired.

00:06:49.374 --> 00:06:52.166
Because of Mr. Albert?

00:06:53.346 --> 00:06:57.076
Candy, why didn't you
discuss this with us first?

00:06:57.349 --> 00:06:59.249
Why?

00:06:59.651 --> 00:07:03.314
I didn't want to bother
the older nurses.

00:07:03.689 --> 00:07:06.988
Candy, the older nurses
don't just tease the younger sisters.

00:07:07.926 --> 00:07:10.451
Let's go to Dr. Leonard.

00:07:11.096 --> 00:07:12.324
I...

00:07:13.031 --> 00:07:15.158
Let's solve this with Dr. Leonard!

00:07:16.001 --> 00:07:17.593
Everyone, let's go together!

00:07:24.302 --> 00:07:25.867
No! It's out of the question!

00:07:26.912 --> 00:07:30.649
What I decided will not change.

00:07:30.849 --> 00:07:33.485
Even if it's wrong?

00:07:33.685 --> 00:07:35.780
- Yes!
- It's nonsense!

00:07:36.321 --> 00:07:37.815
It's too much!

00:07:37.989 --> 00:07:41.221
Go back on duty!

00:07:41.421 --> 00:07:44.890
Dr. Leonard,
we reviewed Candy's behaviour...

00:07:45.097 --> 00:07:47.425
Now is not a good time to punish her.

00:07:49.735 --> 00:07:52.199
Mr. Albert is not the only patient.

00:07:52.971 --> 00:07:54.039
Doris...

00:07:54.239 --> 00:07:57.876
The reason I insisted on doing this
was because of Catherine's death.

00:07:58.076 --> 00:07:59.500
We, too.

00:08:00.311 --> 00:08:02.796
Catherine risked her life in the war

00:08:02.996 --> 00:08:06.714
to save people's lives
regardless of their identity.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.150
And she sacrificed her life.

00:08:16.528 --> 00:08:19.656
Catherine was risking her life
on the battlefield.

00:08:20.932 --> 00:08:25.637
But now we are abandoning
Mr. Albert here, at home.

00:08:25.837 --> 00:08:27.830
How would she feel about that?

00:08:38.216 --> 00:08:40.446
Please don't fire Candy.

00:08:41.519 --> 00:08:44.424
Would Catherine agree with you?

00:08:44.604 --> 00:08:45.773
Yes.

00:08:45.923 --> 00:08:47.718
Why are you so sure?

00:08:48.793 --> 00:08:51.111
Catherine and we are all nurses.

00:08:51.311 --> 00:08:53.764
Candy is a nurse, too.

00:08:57.335 --> 00:08:59.654
I hope Catherine is like you.

00:08:59.954 --> 00:09:02.207
Can Candy come back to work?

00:09:02.407 --> 00:09:04.571
It's not me who wants this.

00:09:04.976 --> 00:09:06.851
It's Catherine.

00:09:07.312 --> 00:09:09.280
Thank you.

00:09:09.547 --> 00:09:11.116
It's great, Candy!

00:09:11.316 --> 00:09:12.717
Thank you everybody.

00:09:12.917 --> 00:09:15.251
You should thank Catherine.

00:09:18.956 --> 00:09:21.993
Catherine, we never met before,

00:09:22.193 --> 00:09:23.718
but you helped me.

00:09:25.096 --> 00:09:29.294
I can only express my gratitude
in front of the photo.

00:09:33.938 --> 00:09:36.634
You were an army nurse,
willing to sacrifice your life.

00:09:37.308 --> 00:09:40.709
The war in Europe must be intense.

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:48.917
Franny, I hope you are safe and well.

00:09:50.188 --> 00:09:54.090
You have to come back alive
and yell to me like before.

00:09:56.327 --> 00:09:59.626
Candy, you don't have to do
the night shifts anymore.

00:10:00.565 --> 00:10:02.999
Why? I...

00:10:03.601 --> 00:10:06.604
You have to take care of Mr. Albert
during the night.

00:10:08.339 --> 00:10:10.174
Dr. Leonard said if problems arise

00:10:10.374 --> 00:10:12.333
he can come back to the hospital
for treatment.

00:10:13.744 --> 00:10:15.678
Dr. Leonard...

00:10:25.857 --> 00:10:28.759
Mr. Albert should feel relieved now.

00:10:28.959 --> 00:10:31.190
Right! Let me scare him.

00:10:48.079 --> 00:10:50.138
Easy...

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:00.555
He's not home.

00:11:08.833 --> 00:11:10.391
Mr. Albert...

00:11:23.814 --> 00:11:26.146
Mr. Albert! Poope!

00:11:29.954 --> 00:11:33.651
Is it possible that he thinks
I got fired from the hospital?

00:11:35.993 --> 00:11:37.888
There's no message.

00:11:38.095 --> 00:11:41.524
Mr. Albert didn't want
to get me involved.

00:11:42.466 --> 00:11:44.491
And it took him so long
to start getting well...

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:48.800
Someone was waiting for me at home.

00:11:49.006 --> 00:11:51.668
That feeling made me so happy everyday!

00:11:53.577 --> 00:11:54.967
Mr. Albert...

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:58.215
Your smile was nice and warm.

00:11:58.415 --> 00:12:02.115
We finally got together.

00:12:03.087 --> 00:12:05.749
Why did you leave me?

00:12:09.827 --> 00:12:14.265
I didn't notice.
I thought he was in the room.

00:12:14.465 --> 00:12:15.593
Thanks.

00:12:48.966 --> 00:12:52.236
Come, cheap stuff!

00:12:52.436 --> 00:12:55.601
On sale today!
You will regret if you don't come!

00:12:55.806 --> 00:12:57.603
Hurry!

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:06.044
Mr. Albert doesn't like noisy places.

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:15.724
What were you trying to do?

00:13:19.029 --> 00:13:21.725
- Aren't you handing it over?
- Arrogant guy!

00:13:22.265 --> 00:13:23.863
Speak!

00:13:24.063 --> 00:13:26.136
I already apologized.

00:13:26.336 --> 00:13:27.760
This voice...

00:13:31.374 --> 00:13:33.672
Do you know who I am?

00:13:34.778 --> 00:13:37.372
I am Neil from the Adley family!

00:13:38.548 --> 00:13:40.448
So what?

00:13:42.585 --> 00:13:45.520
How dare you touch me?
You will regret it!

00:13:48.625 --> 00:13:52.061
You drove to give us a trouble.

00:13:52.696 --> 00:13:54.926
I drove..

00:13:56.166 --> 00:13:58.691
Why did you get a flat tire?

00:13:59.135 --> 00:14:01.501
A child from a rich family.

00:14:01.771 --> 00:14:03.295
Leave me alone!

00:14:04.941 --> 00:14:06.875
Let me teach you a lesson!

00:14:08.178 --> 00:14:09.629
Stop!

00:14:09.829 --> 00:14:10.981
Candy!

00:14:11.181 --> 00:14:12.378
What is it with her?

00:14:12.582 --> 00:14:15.079
You are three men against one!

00:14:15.279 --> 00:14:17.446
Shut up! You want to be beaten too?

00:14:17.687 --> 00:14:20.884
Don't bully him, let him go!

00:14:22.325 --> 00:14:24.389
This woman really needs a lesson.

00:14:24.594 --> 00:14:26.494
She doesn't want to live anymore.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:28.657
Let me kill you with my fist!

00:14:29.098 --> 00:14:31.896
How could you hit a woman?

00:14:38.307 --> 00:14:40.104
Bitch!

00:14:48.484 --> 00:14:50.611
Neil, run!

00:15:04.534 --> 00:15:06.832
It should be safe here.

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:10.633
I won't thank you for this.
Mind your own business!

00:15:15.144 --> 00:15:17.308
What a hopeless guy!

00:15:18.548 --> 00:15:20.607
I haven't worked out for a long time.

00:15:25.321 --> 00:15:27.949
Why did she save me?

00:15:28.691 --> 00:15:30.556
Didn't she hate me?

00:15:31.494 --> 00:15:35.260
She forgot about what happened before
and helped me out of the trouble.

00:15:38.801 --> 00:15:40.530
What a nosy girl!

00:15:43.272 --> 00:15:45.532
I can't thank her.

00:15:46.709 --> 00:15:49.143
She wanted to help me herself.

00:15:52.381 --> 00:15:55.241
I can't find Mr. Albert anywhere.

00:16:03.626 --> 00:16:05.253
The light in the room...

00:16:06.629 --> 00:16:08.290
Mr. Albert!

00:16:16.672 --> 00:16:18.162
Mr. Albert!

00:16:20.309 --> 00:16:22.504
What a noisy girl!

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:26.079
Mr. Albert!

00:16:27.783 --> 00:16:29.273
Welcome back, Candy.

00:16:30.819 --> 00:16:33.882
Mr. Albert, where have you been?

00:16:36.225 --> 00:16:38.327
I have been looking for you.

00:16:38.527 --> 00:16:39.758
Sorry.

00:16:40.596 --> 00:16:42.898
I went to work part-time.

00:16:43.098 --> 00:16:46.635
Work part-time?
You knew I was fired.

00:16:46.835 --> 00:16:47.799
No.

00:16:47.999 --> 00:16:51.107
The money isn't much,
but I shall be on my own.

00:16:51.307 --> 00:16:55.036
What for?
You should stay home and rest.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:59.137
No, a little exercising
is good for my memory.

00:16:59.815 --> 00:17:01.750
And it can keep me busy.

00:17:02.350 --> 00:17:04.453
Candy, why are you so dirty?

00:17:04.653 --> 00:17:06.953
This is because...

00:17:09.625 --> 00:17:12.494
You didn't go to fight, did you?
Just like Terry.

00:17:12.694 --> 00:17:14.327
Terry? Fight?

00:17:14.527 --> 00:17:17.696
Mr. Albert, you remember that?

00:17:39.554 --> 00:17:40.953
Mr. Albert...

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.821
No.

00:17:43.558 --> 00:17:46.161
Didn't you mention that to me before?

00:17:46.361 --> 00:17:48.320
- Seems like it.
- Candy.

00:17:48.697 --> 00:17:50.494
Don't be upset.

00:17:51.333 --> 00:17:54.097
It seems like that I am the one
who lost the memory.

00:17:54.736 --> 00:17:56.897
Who is the patient now?

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:01.668
Mr. Albert is getting better
little by little.

00:18:04.546 --> 00:18:07.037
Go take a shower now.

00:18:14.156 --> 00:18:17.604
I was a fool,
looking for you here and there.

00:18:17.804 --> 00:18:20.319
No. I shouldn't have sneaked out.

00:18:24.499 --> 00:18:27.127
Mr. Albert, you won't go out
by yourself, will you?

00:18:27.836 --> 00:18:30.498
You are having
a good appetite today, Candy.

00:18:31.606 --> 00:18:35.508
I did exercise a bit.
At work, obviously.

00:18:36.378 --> 00:18:37.813
I should begin working, too.

00:18:38.013 --> 00:18:41.246
I will get you something
for your trip to Broadway.

00:18:41.583 --> 00:18:43.642
Does Mr. Albert want to go along?

00:18:43.852 --> 00:18:46.271
Seeing Terry
may bring back some memories.

00:18:46.471 --> 00:18:48.187
No, maybe next time.

00:18:48.387 --> 00:18:50.381
I don't want to get between you two.

00:18:51.727 --> 00:18:54.389
Mr. Albert...

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:15.607
It is the East

00:19:16.151 --> 00:19:17.778
and Juliet is the sun!

00:19:19.187 --> 00:19:20.422
No.

00:19:20.622 --> 00:19:23.286
The audience in the back
will not hear me.

00:19:24.326 --> 00:19:28.319
For Candy, I got to practice harder.

00:19:33.235 --> 00:19:36.500
Arise, fair sun!

00:19:43.311 --> 00:19:44.471
Susanna.

00:19:45.313 --> 00:19:48.305
Terry, your voice is loud enough.

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:52.068
Sorry. Please don't bother me
when I'm practicing.

00:19:52.268 --> 00:19:53.953
Even though I don't know
who that person is...

00:19:54.288 --> 00:19:56.836
You are not performing to the audience.

00:19:57.036 --> 00:19:58.059
What?

00:19:58.259 --> 00:20:01.659
That woman in Chicago
is your real audience.

00:20:01.809 --> 00:20:04.464
What do you mean, Susanna?

00:20:05.199 --> 00:20:09.067
I heard you reserved the best seats.

00:20:13.608 --> 00:20:16.960
Is that person Candy?

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:18.479
Please leave.

00:20:18.679 --> 00:20:21.639
Terry, don't invite her!

00:20:23.551 --> 00:20:26.247
Don't let Candy come to Broadway!

00:20:27.054 --> 00:20:28.487
I don't understand.

00:20:32.827 --> 00:20:36.228
Please, don't invite Candy!

00:20:36.931 --> 00:20:39.832
Who are you to say something like this?

00:20:41.035 --> 00:20:44.903
Terry, I like you! I love you!

00:20:53.781 --> 00:20:56.648
I don't want to lose you!

00:21:04.325 --> 00:21:06.122
Terry!

00:21:09.263 --> 00:21:13.962
Candy dreamed about Terry
calling her name.

00:21:15.069 --> 00:21:18.163
But she couldn't do anything.

00:21:18.939 --> 00:21:23.706
Chicago and New York
are thousands of miles away.
